implement a friend group that is accessed from the profile screen. allow people to join a group by showing a QR code and the other person scans the code or by email address, when sharing by email address the other user would need to confirm the friend request. This confirmation request should be shown in push notifications and shown in app on launch with a snackbar and on the profile screen
The push notification permission request should be moved to a screen in the FTUE and the reason for the request be given as supporting downloading (if browse is enabled) and friend requests.
